<translate>
==== PrimaryAnimMask ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Specifies the animation mask that will be applied to the animation when the item is in the main hand.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
PrimaryAnimMask = HoldingTorchRight,
</syntaxhighlight>
</translate>

